  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Remote control makes it easy to adjust light brightness and mode"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Supports 16 different color options to create the ideal atmosphere"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Energy-saving design with automatic shutoff helps reduce energy consumption"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Operating Instructions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "You can operate the Remote Controlled 16-Color RGBW Puck Lights both manually and via remote control. Press the button on the light to turn it on/off and cycle through colors. Use the remote to easily switch colors, adjust brightness, select modes, and set a timer for convenient control.Additionally, use Reclosable Fastener Mounting Tape to securely attach the Puck Lights in place."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Note: Click to download the 3D file of Halloween Jack-O'-Lantern on Maker World.The model in this file includes a base designed for an LED Lamp, not the RGBW light. If you plan to use the RGBW light (KC007) to fit the base of the Halloween Jack-O'-Lantern model, make sure to download the 3D file for the Jack-O'-Lantern handle for KC007 with holes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Requires three AAA batteries (batteries not included)."
